  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.chopping_board": "Chopping board",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.chopping_board.text": "Place food on the board, then right-click it with a knife to lean in: every click brings the knife down for one cut. With a bare hand you can put things on the board or take them off. Any item can go on a board, which is handy for decorating.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.stove": "Stove",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.stove.text": "Feed it coal, charcoal or sticks (sticks burn out quickly) and light it with flint and steel. A lit stove or a campfire heats whatever stands on top of it.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.cooking_pot": "Cooking pot",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.cooking_pot.text": "Put it on a heat source and pour in a water bucket. Right-click with a bare hand to lean in and drag ingredients into the pot. Then right-click with the wooden spoon, grab the handle and keep stirring: stop for too long and it sticks and burns. Serve with bowls.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.frying_pan": "Frying pan",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.frying_pan.text": "Put it on a heat source. Right-click with a bare hand to drag food in. Right-click with the spatula, grab its handle and flick the mouse up to flip the food when it sizzles, or it chars into scraps.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.mortar": "Mortar and pestle",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.mortar.text": "Put grain in the mortar and right-click to grind it, for example wheat into flour.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.mixing_bowl": "Mixing bowl",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.mixing_bowl.text": "Add flour, eggs, sugar or a water bottle and mix with the wooden spoon to make doughs and batters. An empty mixing bowl can also carry a whole pot of finished soup.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.oven": "Brick oven",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.oven.text": "Light it like a stove and put dough or batter inside. It dings when it's ready. Leave it in too long and it burns.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.plates": "Plates",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.plates.text": "Craft a raw plate from clay and fire it in a furnace. Craft a plate with the parts of a meal to get a placeable dish, then eat it bite by bite. You get the plate back.",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.farming": "Farming",
  "cookbook.cozycookery.guide.farming.text": "Tomatoes climb a trellis: plant seeds on it and pick them when ripe. Cabbage grows from seeds, onions from an onion and garlic from a single clove. All four also grow wild across the world.",
